<title>UK: UK meals and feeds attract little interest.</title>
<headline>UK meals and feeds attract little interest.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-09-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Buyers were showing interest on the UK meals and feeds market despite lower prices on Wednesday.</p>
<p>&quot;We saw a flurry of activity late on Tuesday but there has been no follow-through today,&quot; said a trader.</p>
<p>High protein soymeal ex-mill was around one stg down while stores were one to 1.50 stg lower following the easier in close in Chicago overnight.</p>
<p>--Jim Ballantyne, London Newsroom +44 171 542 8062</p>
